@startuml
' Activity 3: play a chapter and save progress. Transcribed from Diagram/ACTIVITY/act-3-play.drawio.
skinparam wrapWidth 150
|Child|
|Game (FE)|
|System (BE)|

|Child|
start
:Continue the game;
|Game (FE)|
:Load the chapter of the current release;
|Child|
:Play scenes, choices and mini-games;
|Game (FE)|
:Give instant feedback, keep first answers;
:Submit the chapter batch;
|System (BE)|
:Chapter batch; <<object>>
switch ()
case ([batch invalid])
  :Reject the batch, save nothing;
  stop
case ([next chapter])
  :Recompute hidden stats from the frozen chapter;
  :Grade mini-games from first answers;
  :Save choices, results and progress;
case ([chapter already saved])
endswitch
:Return chapters done and next chapter;
|Game (FE)|
if () then ([chapters left])
  :Unlock the next chapter;
  stop
else ([all chapters of current\nrelease done])
  |Child|
  :See the run COMPLETED;
  stop
endif
@enduml
